{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fynn's Passage is a stylized Third-Person Shooter and Action RPG game with Trading and Puzzle Elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight with a Sword or a Gun...or both!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your <strong>sword</strong> equipped you can slice up your enemies and execute combo attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your <strong>pulse rifle</strong> equipped you can shoot up your enemies from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between the two weapons seamlessly for balanced gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot, Trade, and Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover collectible items as you explore. Trade with memorable NPCs to obtain\u00a0<strong>Rare</strong>\u00a0items. Completing a full <strong>Set</strong> will reward the player with a\u00a0<strong>Charm. </strong>Each <strong>Charm\u00a0</strong>will unlock a unique player <strong>buff</strong>, enhancing gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to solve puzzles in order to obtain <strong>key items</strong> that are necessary to progress through the game. Each puzzle is unique and challenging.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience grand boss fights involving a combination of solving puzzles, combat, and damage phases. Get ready to utilize all the skills you've learned up to this point in the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Didn't find all items you were looking for? Playing again will <strong>Re-Roll</strong> all the collectible items in the game, giving you more opportunities to complete your <strong>collections</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All living species were forced underground thousands of years ago. Now play as &quot;Fynn&quot; as you seek to uncover the secrets of these mysterious caverns. Speak with NPCs to learn more about what happened in the old times. Observe unique items that bare clues to a world long past. Strive to eventually make your way to the surface in search of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892330?t=1765862152","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892330/ee760404da19235ee3002786014dd22102f768f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765862152","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892330/6e3db4b6635d90e87ca8f9a36425f1621bc39b7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765862152","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892330/6e3db4b6635d90e87ca8f9a36425f1621bc39b7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765862152","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4020710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fynn's Passage is a stylized Third-Person Shooter and Action RPG game with Trading and Puzzle Elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight with a Sword or a Gun...or both!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your <strong>sword</strong> equipped you can slice up your enemies and execute combo attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your <strong>pulse rifle</strong> equipped you can shoot up your enemies from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between the two weapons seamlessly for balanced gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot, Trade, and Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover collectible items as you explore. Trade with memorable NPCs to obtain\u00a0<strong>Rare</strong>\u00a0items. Completing a full <strong>Set</strong> will reward the player with a\u00a0<strong>Charm. </strong>Each <strong>Charm\u00a0</strong>will unlock a unique player <strong>buff</strong>, enhancing gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to solve puzzles in order to obtain <strong>key items</strong> that are necessary to progress through the game. Each puzzle is unique and challenging.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience grand boss fights involving a combination of solving puzzles, combat, and damage phases. Get ready to utilize all the skills you've learned up to this point in the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Didn't find all items you were looking for? Playing again will <strong>Re-Roll</strong> all the collectible items in the game, giving you more opportunities to complete your <strong>collections</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All living species were forced underground thousands of years ago. Now play as &quot;Fynn&quot; as you seek to uncover the secrets of these mysterious caverns. Speak with NPCs to learn more about what happened in the old times. Observe unique items that bare clues to a world long past. Strive to eventually make your way to the surface in search of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Wobble Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892330/db9509128ea40d0537e1e1810b36f75459283437/header.jpg?t=1765862152","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025-2028 Wobble Games. All Rights Reserved. Fynn\u2019s Passage\u2122 is a trademark of Wobble Games.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</